ntact the Search Committee Chair, Professor Jere Hammer, Interim Director of Nursing (hammerj1@tamuv.edu). All positions are security-sensitive. Applicants are subject to a criminal history investigation, and employment is contingent upon the institution’s verification of credentials and/or other information required by the institution’s procedures, including the completion of the criminal history check. Equal Opportunity/Veterans/Disability Employer."
